# Two pipes with nothing between them: DS0103, with a fix that removes one.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | | take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..29
  PIPELINE@0..28
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    PIPE@20..21 "|"
    WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
    TAKE_OP@22..28
      IDENT@22..26 "take"
      WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
      LITERAL@27..28
        LONG@27..28 "5"
  WHITESPACE@28..29 "\n"

error[DS0103]: two `|` in a row
  --> query:1:19
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | | take 5
  |                   ^ no operator after this `|`
  |
  = help: remove the extra `|`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | take 5
which parses without errors
